    "title": "feat: mr note create support for internal notes/threads",
    "description": "## Description\n\nAdds support for internal notes on `mr note create`, allowing the creation of internal notes as well as replying to them.\n\n## Related Issues\n\nResolves #8557\n\n## How has this been tested?\n\n- Expanded the `mr_note_create` test suite to support various combinations of flags working alongside `--internal`\n- Tested the flag itself in a GitLab project, see the video below\n\n## Screenshots\n\n![firefox_72lswLnXMj](/uploads/0bca9218f6458ccdc8d28121fbe99769/firefox_72lswLnXMj.mp4){width=900 height=485}",
